        "Any valid pair is acceptable only when a test has one unique pair."
      ],
      "examples": [
        {
          "input": {"values": [2, 6, 11, 14], "target": 16},
          "output": [0, 3],
          "explanation": "The readings at positions 0 and 3 add to 16."
